        "reason": "Study provides strong evidence for PFAS removal and interfacial sorption behavior in foam fractionation of landfill leachate using various cosurfactant headgroup charges, but lacks full reporting of gas flow, bubble size, cosurfactant concentration, and individual PFAS concentrations needed to normalize or compare performance quantitatively across studies and operating regimes.",
