            "S02-E04",
            "S02-E05"
          ],
          "interpretation": "PFAS removal from bulk leachate was quantified via log removal coefficient based on concentration decrease over 60 min batch operation. Long-chain PFASs exhibited high removals (R ~1.2\u20134; 93.7\u201399.99% removal), many reaching below detection in <15 min.",
          "reported_term": "Overall removal; log removal coefficient R = log(C0/Ce) after 60 min"
        },
